OL,3,AUS consortium wins huge Kenya mining
OL,4,Adeal, beating Chinese rivals
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe deal comes as Washington seeks
OL,7,Fgreater access to Africa's minerals,
OL,8,Faiming to strengthen US supply chains
OL,9,Fand compete with China.
